          "Calculate $\\left(\\frac{4}{5}\\right)^2 = \\frac{16}{25}$.",
          "Subtract $\\frac{16}{25}$ from 1 to find $\\cos^2\\theta = \\frac{9}{25}$.",
          "Take the square root of both sides to get $\\cos\\theta = \\pm\\frac{3}{5}$."
