          "Calculate $\\left(-\\frac{2}{7}\\right)^2 = \\frac{4}{49}$.",
          "Subtract to get $\\sin^2\\theta = 1 - \\frac{4}{49} = \\frac{45}{49}$.",
          "Take the square root: $\\sin\\theta = \\pm\\frac{\\sqrt{45}}{7}$."
